<aside id="welcome-notice" class="welcome-notice" role="region" aria-labelledby="welcome-title" hidden>
 <div class="welcome-copy"><span class="eyebrow category">A LITTLE DISCLAIMER</span><h2 id="welcome-title">Famous among friends.</h2><p>Big magazine energy. Absolutely no legal department. Vanity Vair is a not-for-profit parody, made by friends, for friends—not affiliated with Vanity Fair or Condé Nast. Our cover stars still have to pay for their own coffee. <a href="#legal">The serious bit</a>.</p></div>
 <div class="welcome-actions"><button class="button" type="button" data-acknowledge>Haha, OK</button><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-acknowledge>I’ll see you in court</button><small>Either button means “I get it, it’s a spoof.”</small></div>
</aside>
<style>
 .welcome-notice[hidden]{display:none}.welcome-notice{position:fixed;z-index:25;bottom:20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:min(1080px,calc(100% - 40px));max-height:calc(100dvh - 40px);overflow:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 210px;gap:30px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:3px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:0 8px 45px #0003;padding:26px 30px}.welcome-copy .eyebrow{font-size:9px}.welcome-copy h2{font:400 34px/1.1 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.6px;margin:10px 0 12px}.welcome-copy p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}.welcome-copy .welcome-support{margin-top:12px}.welcome-copy .welcome-cookies{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}.welcome-copy a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.welcome-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:10px}.welcome-actions .button{width:100%;font-size:12px}.welcome-actions small{font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}
 @media(max-width:760px){.welcome-notice{bottom:12px;width:calc(100% - 24px);max-height:calc(100dvh - 24px);grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:20px;gap:18px}.welcome-copy h2{font-size:30px}.welcome-copy p{font-size:12px}.welcome-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.welcome-actions .button{padding:12px 8px;font-size:11px}.welcome-actions small{grid-column:1/-1}}
</style>
<script>
 const notice=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#welcome-notice')!;
 const key='vv-disclaimer-acknowledged-v1';
 function remembered(){try{if(localStorage.getItem(key)==='1')return true;}catch{}return document.cookie.split(';').some(cookie=>cookie.trim()==='vv-disclaimer=1');}
 notice.hidden=remembered();
 notice.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-acknowledge]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{
  try{localStorage.setItem(key,'1');}catch{document.cookie=`vv-disclaimer=1; Path=/; Max-Age=31536000; SameSite=Lax${location.protocol==='https:'?'; Secure':''}`;}
  notice.hidden=true;
 }));
 window.addEventListener('storage',event=>{if(event.key===key&&event.newValue==='1')notice.hidden=true;});
</script>
